The American Air Power Heritage Museum is located at the Confederate Air Force headquarters in Midland, Texas.

315
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:37,680
It houses the world's largest collection of combat aircraft flown in World War II,

316
00:26:38,220 --> 00:26:41,200
and all are still in flying condition.

